1–159 lbs</td>\n<td>165–172 cm / 65–68 in</td>\n<td>114 cm / 44.9 in</td>\n<td>60 cm / 23.6 in</td>\n<td>102 cm / 40.2 in</td>\n<td>119 cm / 46.9 in</td>\n<td>77 cm / 30.3 in</td>\n<td>71 cm / 28 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mother XL</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>72–80 kg / 159–176 lbs</td>\n<td>170–178 cm / 67–70 in</td>\n<td>116 cm / 45.7 in</td>\n<td>58 cm / 22.8 in</td>\n<td>103 cm / 40.6 in</td>\n<td>123 cm / 48.4 in</td>\n<td>80 cm / 31.5 in</td>\n<td>73 cm / 28.7 in</td>\n</tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<p>Welcome bunny season with our Autumn Peter Rabbit Mommy and Me Pajamas — a cozy two-piece set that turns bedtime and lazy mornings into a matching moment. Cut from lightweight, breathable 4-layer cotton gauze, the fabric softens with every wash so both mom and little one can curl up in something that feels as good as it looks. Warm autumn tones — cream, caramel, muted sage — let the watercolor bunnies, acorns, and mushrooms do all the talking.</p>\n\n<p>Inspired by a woodland walk at golden hour, the print gathers up Peter Rabbit, his leafy friends, and little harvest vignettes into a story you and your daughter can wear together. Pair them for a photo-ready brunch, a weekend at the pumpkin patch, the annual family portrait, or a cozy night of storybooks and hot cocoa. These pajamas make every moment match — effortlessly.</p>\n\n<h3>Key Features:</h3>\n<ul>\n  <li>\n<strong>Breathable cotton gauze:</strong> 4-layer muslin weave keeps air moving and skin happy.</li>\n  <li>\n<strong>Elevated details:</strong> Notch collar, contrast piping, buttoned placket, and a chest pocket on every top.</li>\n  <li>\n<strong>Mom + mini matching:</strong> Identical print on both sizes for head-to-toe family twinning.</li>\n  <li>\n<strong>Everyday ease:</strong> Elastic-waist pants, relaxed fit, and a printed top that layers effortlessly.</li>\n  <li>\n<strong>Photo-ready neutrals:</strong> Cream palette styles with any home backdrop — Thanksgiving, birthdays, holiday cards.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>Slip into the softest matching moment of the season — grab your set and make this autumn one you'll want to frame.</p>","seo":{"title":"Peter Rabbit Mommy & Me Pajamas | Dress Like Mommy","description":"Shop our Autumn Peter Rabbit matching mommy-and-me pajamas — soft cotton Short-Sleeve Set for mom + daughter. Kids 2Y–10Y, Mom S–XL."},"tags":["Autumn","Beige","Bunny","Child 2-3yr","Child 4-5yr","Child 6-8yr","Child 9-10yr","Cotton Gauze","Cream","Fall","Floral","https://detail.1688.com/offer/828526529351.html","Matching Family Pajamas","Mom Size L","Mom Size M","Mom Size S","Mom Size XL","Mommy and Me","Muslin","Pajamas","Peter Rabbit","Rabbit","Short Sleeve Pajamas","Woodland"],"variants":{"edges":[{"node":{"sku":"DLM-VCF-KID2Y-CREAM","title":"Child 2 Years / Autumn Peter Rabbit","price":"35.99","compareAtPrice":"40.24","inventoryPolicy":"DENY","inventoryItem":{"tracked":true,"requiresShipping":true}}},{"node":{"sku":"DLM-VCF-KID3Y-CREAM","title":"Child 3 Years / Autumn Peter Rabbit","price":"35.99","compareAtPrice":"40.24","inventoryPolicy":"DENY","inventoryItem":{"tracked":true,"requiresShipping":true}}},{"node":{"sku":"DLM-VCF-KID4Y-CREAM","title":"Child 4 Years / Autumn Peter Rabbit","price":"35.99","compareAtPrice":"40.24","inventoryPolicy":"DENY","inventoryItem":{"tracked":true,"requiresShipping":true}}},{"node":{"sku":"DLM-VCF-KID5Y-CREAM","title":"Child 5 Years / Autumn Peter Rabbit","price":"35.99","compareAtPrice":"40.24","inventoryPolicy":"DENY","inventoryItem":{"tracked":true,"requiresShipping":true}}},{"node":{"sku":"DLM-VCF-KID67Y-CREAM","title":"Child 6-7 Years / Autumn Peter Rabbit","price":"35.99","compareAtPrice":"40.24","inventoryPolicy":"DENY","inventoryItem":{"tracked":true,"requiresShipping":true}}},{"node":{"sku":"DLM-VCF-KID8Y-CREAM","title":"Child 8 Years / Autumn Peter Rabbit","price":"35.99","compareAtPrice":"40.24","inventoryPolicy":"DENY","inventoryItem":{"tracked":true,"requiresShipping":true}}},{"node":{"sku":"DLM-VCF-KID91